        title: "SIL Support Basis and Support Model",
        existingProse: "[SIL_SUPPORT_BASIS - SIL Support Basis]\nDescription: Establishes the approved/current basis for SIL implementation. Instructions: Capture support/funding basis, service agreement status and outstanding evidence.\n\n[SIL_SUPPORT_MODEL - SIL Support Model]\nDescription: Defines the approved/current SIL support model. Instructions: Use founder-approved model types but allow other approved configurations where evidence establishes them.",
        fixedContent: "[SIL_SUPPORT_BASIS - SIL Support Basis]\nThe SIL support basis must be established before the support model is treated as implementable.\n\n[SIL_SUPPORT_MODEL - SIL Support Model]\nSIL model types include 1:1, 1:2, 1:3, SHARED_SUPPORT, SLEEPOVER, ACTIVE_OVERNIGHT, DROP_IN_SUPPORT, IRREGULAR_SIL and OTHER_APPROVED_SIL_MODEL. The plan must not invent a support model.",
