        completionPrompt: "[SIL_SUPPORT_BASIS - SIL Support Basis]\nComplete the support basis from current approved evidence and identify any missing or conflicting support basis.\n\n[SIL_SUPPORT_MODEL - SIL Support Model]\nSelect and describe the support model only where approved/current evidence supports it. Use OTHER_APPROVED_SIL_MODEL only where evidence establishes a valid configuration.",
