        title: "Ratios, Hours, Time Bands and Shared / Individual Support",
        existingProse: "[SUPPORT_RATIO_TIME_BANDS - Support Ratio, Hours and Time Bands]\nDescription: Treats support ratio as a first-class SIL component. Instructions: Establish what ratio applies, when, for what support, individual/shared status, why required, evidence and fallback if unavailable.\n\n[SHARED_INDIVIDUAL_SUPPORT - Shared and Individual Support Distinction]\nDescription: Separates individual support from shared support. Instructions: Do not assume shared support is appropriate because participants live together.",
        fixedContent: "[SUPPORT_RATIO_TIME_BANDS - Support Ratio, Hours and Time Bands]\nRatios must be evidence-based. The plan does not infer ratios from perceived participant complexity.\n\n[SHARED_INDIVIDUAL_SUPPORT - Shared and Individual Support Distinction]\nThe plan must explicitly identify INDIVIDUAL_SUPPORT and SHARED_SUPPORT components and any participant-specific exceptions.",
