        title: "Staff Readiness, Competency and Capacity",
        existingProse: "[STAFF_READINESS_COMPETENCY - Staff Readiness and Competency]\nDescription: Assesses staff competency/readiness required to implement SIL safely. Instructions: Training completed does not automatically equal competent.\n\n[STAFFING_CAPACITY_READINESS - Staffing and Capacity Readiness]\nDescription: Assesses whether operational capacity exists to implement the approved SIL model. Instructions: Do not construct the detailed roster.",
        fixedContent: "[STAFF_READINESS_COMPETENCY - Staff Readiness and Competency]\nSIL implementation requires evidence of staff readiness and, where high-risk support applies, observed competency where required by evidence or policy.\nCRITICAL RULE: TRAINING COMPLETED does NOT automatically equal COMPETENT. Where high-risk support requires observed competency, completion of training alone is insufficient.\n\n[STAFFING_CAPACITY_READINESS - Staffing and Capacity Readiness]\nThe plan assesses capacity to deliver required ratios, competencies, overnight/shared support and continuity requirements. Detailed roster design/allocation belongs to roster planning.",
        fields: ["[STAFF_READINESS_COMPETENCY - Staff Readiness and Competency]", "Table: competency | required? | staff/group affected | evidence | training completed? | observed competency required? | observed competency established? | refresher due? | gap | action owner | status. Competencies include SIL induction, participant-specific induction, care plan familiarity, communication, medication, mealtime, BSP, RP, manual handling, delegated clinical task, emergency response, safeguarding and participant-specific competencies.", "[STAFFING_CAPACITY_READINESS - Staffing and Capacity Readiness]", "Table: required staffing | required ratios | required competencies | coverage requirement | overnight requirement | shared-support requirement | continuity/familiarity consideration | on-call requirement | capacity status | known staffing gap | escalation | ROSTER_READINESS_REQUIRED."],
