        fixedContent: "[DIAGNOSES_HEALTH_CONDITIONS - Diagnoses and Health Conditions]\nFor each established condition include Condition, Source, Current Impact and Support Required. The value is translation into safe service-delivery support, not a diagnosis list.\n\n[PHYSICAL_HEALTH_OVERVIEW - Physical Health Overview]\nThe overview summarises established conditions, current functional/support impact, routine support needs and key risk themes. It must not merely list diagnoses.",
