        fixedContent: "[MONITORING_DETERIORATION - Monitoring and Deterioration Indicators]\nMonitoring connects daily support to escalation. It should include relevant observations, baseline changes and deterioration indicators supported by evidence.\n\n[ESCALATION_REQUIREMENTS - Escalation Requirements]\nControlled escalation levels: ROUTINE_MONITORING; CONTACT_MANAGER_OR_ON_CALL; CONTACT_GP_OR_CLINICIAN; URGENT_CLINICAL_REVIEW; CALL_000. These are operational escalation levels and do not authorise the model to invent clinical thresholds.",
