        fixedContent: "[PATHWAY_A_AUTHORISED_RP_DETAILS - Pathway A - Authorised RP Details]\nPATHWAY A - AUTHORISED RESTRICTIVE PRACTICE REPORTING. This pathway applies only to RP uses where valid authority is verified and the practice under review can be compared to that authority.\n\n[PATHWAY_A_IMPLEMENTATION_RECORD - Pathway A - Implementation/Use Record]\nActual implementation must be recorded from implementation evidence, not assumed from the existence of authority.",
