        fixedContent: "[PATHWAY_A_MONTHLY_REPORTING - Pathway A - Monthly Usage/Reporting Summary]\nMonthly reporting must identify reporting month, RP details, use count/frequency, dates/times, duration, circumstances, participant response, injuries/adverse consequences, safeguards, patterns, current authority status, reporting officer and PRODA/Commission reporting status where evidenced. Historical operational evidence may inform workflow but current authority/regulatory sources prevail for obligations and deadlines.\n\n[PATHWAY_A_FINDING - Pathway A - Finding]\nControlled findings: AUTHORISED_WITHIN_SCOPE; AUTHORISED_IMPLEMENTATION_VARIANCE; UNAUTHORISED_RESTRICTIVE_PRACTICE_ESTABLISHED; POTENTIALLY_UNAUTHORISED_FURTHER_EVIDENCE_REQUIRED; AUTHORISATION_CANNOT_BE_VERIFIED; NOT_A_RESTRICTIVE_PRACTICE; INSUFFICIENT_OR_CONFLICTING_EVIDENCE.",
